<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ApostilaLab AI — Estúdio Editorial de Apostilas Técnicas e Didáticas</title>

  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

  <!-- Google Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans, Newsreader (Editorial Serif), JetBrains Mono -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;0,6..72,700;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <!-- Phosphor Icons -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web"></script>

  <!-- html2pdf.js Bundle -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2pdf.js/0.10.1/html2pdf.bundle.min.js"></script>

  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['"Plus Jakarta Sans"', 'sans-serif'],
            serif: ['"Newsreader"', 'Georgia', 'serif'],
            mono: ['"JetBrains Mono"', 'monospace'],
          },
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#EFF6FF',
              100: '#DBEAFE',
              500: '#2563EB',
              600: '#1D4ED8',
              700: '#1E40AF',
              800: '#1E3A8A',
              900: '#172554',
            }
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>

  <style>
    /* Custom Scrollbars */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #F1F5F9;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: 9999px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: #94A3B8;
    }

    /* Editorial Stage Background */
    .stage-bg {
      background-color: #E2E8F0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#CBD5E1 1.25px, transparent 1.25px);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
    }

    /* A4 Sheet Styling on Screen */
    .a4-document-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 210mm;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .a4-sheet {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 297mm;
      padding: 20mm 18mm 20mm 18mm;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12), 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      border-radius: 4px;
      position: relative;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      color: #0F172A;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .a4-sheet {
        padding: 24px 20px;
        min-height: auto;
      }
    }

    /* Editable Elements Focus & Hover Affordance */
    [contenteditable="true"] {
      outline: none;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    [contenteditable="true"]:hover {
      background-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.035);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    }
    [contenteditable="true"]:focus {
      background-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
    }

    /* Editorial Typography inside A4 */
    .editorial-prose p {
      font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 11.5pt;
      line-height: 1.72;
      color: #1E293B;
      margin-bottom: 0.95em;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    /* Avoid breaking critical elements across PDF pages */
    .avoid-break {
      break-inside: avoid;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .html2pdf__page-break {
      height: 0;
      page-break-before: always;
      break-before: page;
    }

    /* Strict Print & Native PDF Styles */
    @media print {
      @page {
        size: A4 portrait;
        margin: 14mm 15mm 14mm 15mm;
      }

      html, body {
        background: #FFFFFF !important;
        color: #000000 !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        height: auto !important;
        overflow: visible !important;
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
        print-color-adjust: exact !important;
      }

      /* Hide UI Chrome */
      .no-print {
        display: none !important;
      }

      #app-layout,
      #main-stage,
      #preview-scroll-area {
        display: block !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        height: auto !important;
        overflow: visible !important;
        background: transparent !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
      }

      .a4-document-container {
        max-width: 100% !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
      }

      .a4-sheet {
        box-shadow: none !important;
        border: none !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        min-height: 0 !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        page-break-after: always;
        break-after: page;
      }

      .a4-sheet:last-child {
        page-break-after: auto;
        break-after: auto;
      }

      .avoid-break {
        break-inside: avoid !important;
        page-break-inside: avoid !important;
      }

      h1, h2, h3, h4 {
        break-after: avoid !important;
        page-break-after: avoid !important;
      }

      [contenteditable="true"]:hover,
      [contenteditable="true"]:focus {
        background: transparent !important;
        box-shadow: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-brand-100 selection:text-brand-800 h-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col">

  <!-- TOP NAVIGATION & EXPORT BAR (Hidden on Print) -->
  <header class="no-print h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-4 lg:px-6 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0 z-30">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <button id="mobile-sidebar-toggle" onclick="toggleMobileSidebar()" class="lg:hidden p-2 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100" title="Abrir Painel de Configuração">
        <i class="ph ph-sliders-horizontal text-xl"></i>
      </button>
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm shadow-brand-700/20">
        <i class="ph-fill ph-book-open-text text-xl"></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h1 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight leading-none">ApostilaLab <span class="text-brand-700">AI</span></h1>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 border border-brand-100 font-semibold">
            Edição GitHub Pages
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 hidden sm:block mt-0.5">Gerador de Apostilas Técnicas e Didáticas com Editor A4 Interativo</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Center Editorial Status Pill -->
    <div class="hidden xl:flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-slate-600">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
      <span>Modo Edição Direta Ativo (<code class="font-mono text-[11px] text-brand-700">clique em qualquer texto da folha A4 para editar</code>)</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Action Buttons -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5">
      <button onclick="openApiKeyPanel()" id="header-api-key-btn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold border transition bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border-amber-200 hover:bg-amber-100" title="Configurar Chave da Gemini API no navegador (GitHub Pages)">
        <i class="ph-fill ph-key text-base text-amber-600" id="header-api-key-icon"></i>
        <span id="header-api-key-label" class="hidden md:inline">Chave API</span>
      </button>

      <button onclick="addNewBlankChapter()" class="hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 transition" title="Inserir um capítulo extra manualmente">
        <i class="ph ph-plus-circle text-base text-brand-700"></i>
        <span>+ Capítulo</span>
      </button>

      <button onclick="exportHtml2Pdf()" id="btn-html2pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 bg-white border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 shadow-sm transition">
        <i class="ph ph-file-pdf text-base text-rose-600"></i>
        <span>Baixar PDF <span class="hidden sm:inline text-slate-400 font-normal">(html2pdf)</span></span>
      </button>

      <button onclick="triggerNativePrint()" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-800 shadow-sm shadow-brand-700/20 transition">
        <i class="ph ph-printer text-base"></i>
        <span>Imprimir / PDF Nativo <span class="hidden sm:inline text-brand-100 font-normal">(Alta Resolução)</span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- MAIN WORKSPACE -->
  <div id="app-layout" class="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden relative">

    <!-- LEFT SIDEBAR: CONFIGURATION & INSPIRATION PANEL -->
    <aside id="config-sidebar" class="no-print w-full sm:w-[400px] lg:w-[430px] bg-white border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col h-full shrink-0 z-20 absolute lg:static inset-y-0 left-0 transform -translate-x-full lg:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-200 ease-in-out shadow-xl lg:shadow-none">
      
      <!-- Sidebar Top Presets Header -->
      <div class="px-5 py-3.5 bg-slate-50/80 border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="ph-fill ph-sparkle text-brand-600"></i>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700">Parâmetros da Apostila</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <select id="preset-selector" onchange="loadPresetTemplate(this.value)" class="text-xs bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-slate-700 font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 max-w-[195px]">
            <option value="">⚡ Exemplos Rápidos...</option>
            <option value="vibracao">Análise de Vibração e Manutenção Preditiva</option>
            <option value="eletrica">Comandos Elétricos e Inversores</option>
            <option value="alinhamento">Alinhamento a Laser e Mancais</option>
            <option value="esp32">Automação com ESP32 e IoT</option>
            <option value="solar">Energia Solar Fotovoltaica</option>
            <option value="enfermagem">Saúde: Biossegurança e UTI</option>
          </select>
          <button onclick="toggleMobileSidebar()" class="lg:hidden p-1 text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800">
            <i class="ph ph-x text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scrollable Form Body -->
      <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-5">

        <!-- 0. GERENCIADOR DE API KEY (LOCALSTORAGE - SEGURO PARA GITHUB PAGES) -->
        <section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/90 overflow-hidden">
          <button
            type="button"
            onclick="toggleApiKeyAccordion()"
            class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between text-left hover:bg-slate-100/80 transition"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="ph-fill ph-key text-brand-600 text-base"></i>
              <div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 block leading-tight">Configuração de API Key (GitHub Pages)</span>
                <span id="sidebar-api-key-status-badge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-amber-700 mt-0.5">
                  ● Ambiente Interno / Sem Chave Local
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <i id="api-key-accordion-chevron" class="ph ph-caret-down text-slate-500 text-sm transition-transform"></i>
          </button>

          <div id="api-key-accordion-body" class="hidden px-3.5 pb-3.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80 space-y-2.5 bg-white">
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Para usar no <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> ou fora do preview, cole sua chave gratuita do <a href="https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 font-semibold underline">Google AI Studio</a>.
            </p>

            <div class="relative">
              <input
                id="input-user-api-key"
                type="password"
                placeholder="AIzaSy..."
                autocomplete="off"
                class="w-full pl-3 pr-9 py-2 text-xs font-mono rounded-lg border border-slate-300 focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none text-slate-800"
              />
              <button
                type="button"
                onclick="toggleApiKeyVisibility()"
                class="absolute right-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700"
                title="Mostrar / Ocultar Chave"
              >
                <i id="api-key-eye-icon" class="ph ph-eye text-base"></i>
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <button
                type="button"
                onclick="saveUserApiKey()"
                class="flex-1 py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg bg-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-800 text-white font-semibold text-xs inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition shadow-sm"
              >
                <i class="ph-bold ph-floppy-disk"></i>
                <span>Salvar no Navegador</span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                onclick="clearUserApiKey()"
                class="py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-rose-50 text-slate-600 hover:text-rose-700 border border-slate-200 font-semibold text-xs inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 transition"
              >
                <i class="ph ph-trash"></i>
                <span>Remover</span>
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200/80 text-[10px] text-emerald-900 leading-snug flex items-start gap-1.5">
              <i class="ph-fill ph-shield-check text-emerald-600 text-sm shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
              <span><strong>100% Seguro para GitHub:</strong> Sua chave fica gravada apenas no <code class="font-mono">localStorage</code> deste navegador e jamais é enviada ao código-fonte do GitHub.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 1. TÍTULO E TEMA -->
        <section class="space-y-3.5">
          <div>
            <label for="input-title" class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              1. Título da Apostila <span class="text-rose-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <input
              id="input-title"
              type="text"
              value="Comandos Elétricos, Inversores de Frequência e Manutenção Preditiva"
              placeholder="Ex: Instalações Elétricas Industriais e NR-10"
              class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none transition font-medium text-slate-900"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="input-topic" class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              Tema / Assunto Detalhado e Escopo <span class="text-rose-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="input-topic"
              rows="3"
              placeholder="Descreva os tópicos essenciais, normas técnicas (ex: ABNT, NR), cálculos, práticas de laboratório ou público-alvo..."
              class="w-full px-3.5 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none transition text-slate-800 leading-relaxed"
            >Dimensionamento e acionamento de motores assíncronos trifásicos, parametrização de inversores de frequência (rampa de aceleração, controle escalar V/f e vetorial), análise de vibração e termografia segundo normas ABNT NBR 5410 e NR-10.</textarea>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. NÍVEL E QUANTIDADE DE CAPÍTULOS -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100">
          <div>
            <label for="input-level" class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              Nível Didático
            </label>
            <select
              id="input-level"
              class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none font-medium text-slate-800"
            >
              <option value="Básico / Introdutório">Básico / Introdutório</option>
              <option value="Técnico / Industrial" selected>Técnico / Industrial</option>
              <option value="Avançado / Engenharia">Avançado / Especialização</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="input-chapters" class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              Nº de Capítulos
            </label>
            <select
              id="input-chapters"
              class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none font-medium text-slate-800"
            >
              <option value="2">2 Capítulos</option>
              <option value="3" selected>3 Capítulos</option>
              <option value="4">4 Capítulos</option>
              <option value="5">5 Capítulos</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. MATERIAL DE INSPIRAÇÃO (ARQUIVOS MULTIMODAIS + NOTAS) -->
        <section class="space-y-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="ph-fill ph-paperclip text-brand-600 text-sm"></i>
              2. Material de Inspiração (Anexos)
            </label>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Multimodal</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Dropzone -->
          <div
            id="file-dropzone"
            onclick="document.getElementById('file-input').click()"
            class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 hover:border-brand-500 bg-slate-50/70 hover:bg-brand-50/30 rounded-xl p-3.5 text-center cursor-pointer transition group"
          >
            <input
              id="file-input"
              type="file"
              multiple
              accept=".txt,.md,.json,.csv,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.pdf"
              class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFilesSelected(this.files)"
            />
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600 group-hover:scale-105 transition">
                <i class="ph ph-upload-simple text-base"></i>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">
                Clique para anexar ou arraste arquivos
              </p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">
                Suporta <span class="font-mono text-slate-700">.pdf, .png, .jpg, .txt, .md, .csv, .json</span> (enviados via <code class="font-mono">inlineData</code> / texto ao Gemini)
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Attached Files Pill List -->
          <div id="attached-files-list" class="space-y-1.5 empty:hidden"></div>

          <!-- Complementary Notes / Paste Area -->
          <div>
            <label for="input-notes" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1">
              Notas Complementares, Ementa ou Transcrição:
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="input-notes"
              rows="2"
              placeholder="Cole aqui trechos de apostilas antigas, sumários, normas, dados técnicos ou a transcrição do vídeo..."
              class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-300 focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none transition text-slate-700"
            ></textarea>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. INSPIRAÇÃO VIA YOUTUBE -->
        <section class="space-y-2.5 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200">
          <label for="input-youtube" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="ph-fill ph-youtube-logo text-rose-600 text-base"></i>
            3. Vídeo do YouTube (Inspiração)
          </label>

          <div class="relative">
            <input
              id="input-youtube"
              type="url"
              oninput="handleYoutubeUrlChange(this.value)"
              placeholder="Cole a URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..."
              class="w-full pl-3.5 pr-9 py-2 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-300 focus:border-brand-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/20 outline-none transition font-mono text-slate-800"
            />
            <button
              id="clear-yt-btn"
              onclick="clearYoutubeInput()"
              class="hidden absolute right-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600"
              title="Limpar URL"
            >
              <i class="ph ph-x-circle text-base"></i>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Dynamic YouTube Thumbnail Preview Card -->
          <div id="youtube-preview-card" class="hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex gap-3 p-2.5 items-center">
              <img
                id="youtube-thumb-img"
                src="https://placehold.co/320x180/1e293b/ffffff?text=YouTube"
                alt="Miniatura do YouTube"
                class="w-28 h-16 object-cover rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shrink-0 bg-slate-900"
                onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/320x180/1e293b/ffffff?text=Video+YouTube'"
              />
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-rose-100 text-rose-700">
                  ID: <span id="youtube-video-id">--</span>
                </span>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 truncate mt-1">Vídeo vinculado como referência</p>
                <a id="youtube-external-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[11px] text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                  Abrir vídeo original <i class="ph ph-arrow-square-out"></i>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Sincere Technical CORS Notice -->
            <div class="bg-amber-50/90 border-t border-amber-200/80 px-3 py-2 text-[11px] text-amber-900 leading-relaxed flex gap-2 items-start">
              <i class="ph-fill ph-info text-amber-600 text-sm shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Aviso Técnico (CORS):</strong> Por restrição de segurança de CORS dos navegadores, páginas web não podem baixar diretamente a faixa de áudio oculta do YouTube. O app utiliza o <strong>link/título via Google Search Grounding</strong> para contextualizar o vídeo, ou você pode colar a transcrição no campo de notas acima para fidelidade literal.
